{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Take:</b> the verbal noun in place of an imperative, like זכור את יום השבת (remember the Sabbath day)." "<b>And you shall come:</b> you yourself, on that day." "<b>The house of Josiah son of Zephaniah:</b> which was in Jerusalem." "<b>Who have come from Babylon:</b> return to Heldai and Tobijah and Jedaiah, like על שפת היאר שב אל ישראל (by the river, return to Israel)."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:10.469783375Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}